  "notes": "NOTES\nRevelation Song. This chart: capo 4, G shapes, sounds in B (PC&D studio key).\nKari Jobe / Gateway version is in D: drop the capo, play A, Em7, G, D\n(same functions as D2, Am7, C2, G). All open, no barres.\nWhole song is one 4-chord loop, verse and chorus identical.\nDynamics are the arrangement: build texture across cycles, never coast.\nRolling 6/8-style feel, long pulses, let strings ring.",
